config IS31FL3743B
    bool "ISSI IS31FL3743B LED matrix driver"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ISSI_IS31FL3743B_ENABLED
    depends on LED_STRIP
    select SPI
    help
      LED strip driver for the IS31FL3743B on SPI, used for the Defy's
      per-key LEDs.

config DEFY_LEDS
    bool "Dygma Defy lights as one LED strip"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_DYGMA_DEFY_LEDS_ENABLED
    depends on LED_STRIP
    help
      Joins the Defy's per-key LEDs and underglow into one strip, and
      switches the underglow's supply.

config DEFY_WS2812_PIO
    bool "WS2812 on the RP2040's PIO, Zephyr's driver with four fixes"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_DYGMA_WS2812_RPI_PICO_PIO_ENABLED
    depends on LED_STRIP
    select PICOSDK_USE_PIO
    help
      A copy of Zephyr 4.1's WS2812 PIO driver for the Defy's underglow. It
      packs four-channel pixels from the top byte, runs the PIO program at
      whatever offset it was loaded, keeps the clock divider's fraction and
      checks that the program fits. The driver's source describes each fix.
